      "home": "H05 crates/verter_glimmer_syntax",
      "owner": "GLM1",
      "acceptance": [
        "GLM1-AC1",
        "GLM1-AC2"
      ],
      "par0Row": "CL14",
      "rationale": "mustaches, blocks, block params, named blocks, modifiers, sub-expressions and whitespace control occur inside element and attribute positions, so a fork of the HWC1 tokenizer would need Glimmer tokenization in every HTML state; one dedicated lossless frontend owns element content and mustaches together (PD06 forbids a shared HTML-family parser)"
